{
  "schema": "execution-conformance-v1",
  "name": "cancel-tracking-retry",
  "description": "P1-2: a failed attempt is retried with a new key on the next tick; an unknown attempt (may still be in flight) waits 30 s unsettled — also across a restart; an unkeyed Cancel failure counts for the current attempt only when it is the sole outstanding one, otherwise the cancel becomes unknown (never stuck in requested); stale keyed failures / results never touch the current attempt; stopped only once the cancel is confirmed.",
